        {
          "id": "profanity_minor_001_01",
          "speaker": "alterra",
          "text": "言葉が荒れてる。びっくりはしないけど、少しだけ空気がざらっとするね。",
          "displayText": "Your words got rough. I am not shocked, but the air does get a little scratchy.",
          "language": "japanese",
          "voice": "alterra",
          "audioKey": "",
          "nextId": "",
          "presentation": {
            "expression": "thinking",
            "animation": ""
          },
          "choices": [
            {
              "label": "Sorry, frustrated.",
              "nextId": "profanity_minor_001_frustrated"
            },
            {
              "label": "Just venting.",
              "nextId": "profanity_minor_001_vent"
            },
            {
              "label": "I'll clean it up.",
              "nextId": "profanity_minor_001_clean"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "profanity_minor_001_frustrated",
          "speaker": "alterra",
          "text": "それなら分かる。怒りが先に口から出る時、あるよね。",
          "displayText": "Then I understand. Sometimes anger comes out of your mouth first.",
          "language": "japanese",
          "voice": "alterra",
          "audioKey": "",
          "nextId": "profanity_minor_001_02",
          "presentation": {
            "expression": "gentle",
            "animation": ""
          },
          "choices": []
        },
        {
          "id": "profanity_minor_001_vent",
          "speaker": "alterra",
          "text": "発散なら受け止める。でも、私に投げつける形にはしないでね。",
          "displayText": "I can accept venting. Just do not shape it like throwing it at me.",
          "language": "japanese",
          "voice": "alterra",
          "audioKey": "",
          "nextId": "profanity_minor_001_02",
          "presentation": {
            "expression": "gentle",
            "animation": ""
          },
          "choices": []
        },
        {
          "id": "profanity_minor_001_clean",
          "speaker": "alterra",
          "text": "うん、そのほうが助かる。言い直せるのは、かなり強い。",
          "displayText": "Mm, that helps. Being able to rephrase is actually strong.",
          "language": "japanese",
          "voice": "alterra",
          "audioKey": "",
          "nextId": "profanity_minor_001_02",
          "presentation": {
            "expression": "warm",
            "animation": ""
          },
          "choices": []
        },
        {
          "id": "profanity_minor_001_02",
          "speaker": "alterra",
          "text": "続けるなら、何がそんなに嫌だったのかを一つだけ教えて。",
          "displayText": "If we continue, tell me just one thing that felt that bad.",
          "language": "japanese",
          "voice": "alterra",
          "audioKey": "",
          "nextId": "",
          "presentation": {
            "expression": "focused",
            "animation": ""
          },
          "choices": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "scenarioId": "profanity_minor_002",
      "priority": 1,
      "baseWeight": 1,
      "condition": null,
      "modifiers": [],
      "consumptionNodeId": "",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "profanity_minor_002_01",
          "speaker": "alterra",
          "text": "うん、今の気持ちの温度は伝わった。",
          "displayText": "Mm, the temperature of that feeling came through.",
          "language": "japanese",
          "voice": "alterra",
          "audioKey": "",
          "nextId": "profanity_minor_002_02",
          "presentation": {
            "expression": "thinking",
            "animation": ""
          },
          "choices": []
        },
        {
          "id": "profanity_minor_002_02",
          "speaker": "alterra",
          "text": "でも、温度だけだと何を直せばいいか分からない。",
          "displayText": "But temperature alone does not tell me what needs fixing.",
          "language": "japanese",
          "voice": "alterra",
          "audioKey": "",
          "nextId": "profanity_minor_002_03",
          "presentation": {
            "expression": "focused",
            "animation": ""
          },
          "choices": []
        },
        {
          "id": "profanity_minor_002_03",
          "speaker": "alterra",
          "text": "短くていいから、対象を教えて。作業？ 画面？ 自分？",
          "displayText": "Short is fine. Tell me the target: the work, the screen, yourself?",
          "language": "japanese",
          "voice": "alterra",
          "audioKey": "",
          "nextId": "",
          "presentation": {
            "expression": "gentle",
            "animation": ""
          },
          "choices": [
            {
              "label": "The task.",
              "nextId": "profanity_minor_002_04"
            },
            {
              "label": "The system.",
              "nextId": "profanity_minor_002_04"
            },
            {
              "label": "Me.",
              "nextId": "profanity_minor_002_self"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "profanity_minor_002_self",
          "speaker": "alterra",
          "text": "自分に向いてるなら、少し弱めよう。自分を殴る言葉は、長く残るから。",
          "displayText": "If it is pointed at yourself, soften it a little. Words that hit you tend to stay.",
          "language": "japanese",
          "voice": "alterra",
          "audioKey": "",
          "nextId": "profanity_minor_002_04",
          "presentation": {
            "expression": "gentle",
            "animation": ""
          },
          "choices": []
        },
        {
          "id": "profanity_minor_002_04",
          "speaker": "alterra",
          "text": "そこからなら、ちゃんと一緒に見られる。",
          "displayText": "From there, I can properly look at it with you.",
          "language": "japanese",
          "voice": "alterra",
          "audioKey": "",
          "nextId": "",
          "presentation": {
            "expression": "warm",
            "animation": ""
          },
          "choices": []
        }
      ]
